# Optional intake endpoint for the contact form.
#
# Leave unset for a purely static deployment: the form then shows the honest
# "your request is ready to send" state with pre-drafted WhatsApp / e-mail
# links, and never claims to have transmitted anything.
#
# Set it to any HTTPS endpoint accepting a JSON POST of the shape:
#   { name, phone, email, subject, date, slot, message }
# e.g. a Formspree/Resend proxy, a Cloud Function, or the firm's CRM webhook.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
